						<h2 class="text-dark text-center mt-4">Description</h2>
						<h5 class="text-dark text-center">F1® Manager is the official
							racing management simulation game of the 2022 Formula One,
							Formula 2, and Formula 3 championships. It offers a more detailed
							career layer in comparison to the My Team mode that Codemasters
							introduced in F1 2020. The game provides a strategy editor, where
							player can schedule pit stops, tyres, and pace for each stint. It
							also features parts development, cost cap, ERS as well as onboard
							cameras used in real life by Formula One teams.</h5>

